    "content": "- Bulk Upload: Available on Growth and Enterprise. Supported file size is up to 5,000 rows per CSV.\n- Standard: Bulk Upload is not included.\n- Shipment status: BOOKED means the shipment is created but ParcelPilot has not yet received a pickup confirmation. PICKED\\_UP means carrier pickup has been confirmed.",
